---
title: agent-sandbox
---
flowchart LR
    classDef external fill:#F59E0B,stroke:#1E293B,color:#1E293B,stroke-width:1px;
    classDef core     fill:#6366F1,stroke:#1E293B,color:#ffffff,stroke-width:1px;
    classDef data     fill:#10B981,stroke:#1E293B,color:#ffffff,stroke-width:1px;
    classDef danger   fill:#EF4444,stroke:#1E293B,color:#ffffff,stroke-width:1px;

    Agent([Agent tool call<br/>argv, read, write]):::external
    Policy[(Policy file<br/>TOML or JSON)]:::data

    subgraph Front["Interfaces"]
        direction TB
        CLI["CLI<br/>run | check | audit verify | inspect"]:::core
        Stdio["JSON Lines over stdio<br/>serve"]:::core
        Lib["Rust library<br/>Sandbox, Engine"]:::core
    end

    Engine{"Decision engine<br/>allowlist, arg patterns,<br/>path resolution, network"}:::core

    subgraph Boundary["Child process boundary"]
        direction TB
        Limits["rlimits, timeout,<br/>output caps, process group"]:::danger
        OS["OS backend<br/>Seatbelt on macOS<br/>Landlock on Linux"]:::danger
        Child(["Command"]):::external
    end

    Audit[(Audit log<br/>JSONL, SHA-256 chain)]:::data

    Agent --> CLI & Stdio & Lib
    Policy -->|compile and resolve| Engine
    CLI & Stdio & Lib -->|request| Engine
    Engine -->|deny: rule and reason| Audit
    Engine -->|allow: resolved binary, cwd| Limits
    Limits --> OS --> Child
    Child -->|exit, signal, output hashes| Audit
